WEBVTT

00:00:59.253 --> 00:01:00.743
was seeing things,

00:01:01.602 --> 00:01:04.288
and they wondered if she'd gone bonkers

00:01:04.312 --> 00:01:05.858
or, because she was an old lady,

00:01:05.882 --> 00:01:09.170
whether she'd had a stroke,
or whether she had Alzheimer's.

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:13.375
And so they asked me
if I would come and see Rosalie,

00:01:14.478 --> 00:01:15.700
the old lady.

00:01:16.327 --> 00:01:17.976
I went in to see her.

00:01:18.358 --> 00:01:22.948
It was evident straightaway
that she was perfectly sane

00:01:22.972 --> 00:01:26.764
and lucid and of good intelligence,

00:01:26.788 --> 00:01:30.153
but she'd been very startled
and very bewildered,